# Optional HippoRAG integration

The optional official retrieval backend uses HippoRAG from the OSU Natural
Language Processing group:

- Source: https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG
- Reviewed commit: `d5c8329422e0a0b834a15874545cb6a74b4f9b26`
- Copyright (c) 2025 OSU Natural Language Processing
- License: MIT. The complete, unmodified copyright and permission notice is
  retained in `LICENSE.HippoRAG` alongside this document.
- License SHA-256:
  `93b43d692b033b76129504448695bfe76ef22d18b11e51352bfab4b5622e5aaa`

The product adapter does not replace or relicense upstream code. Retain the
upstream notice whenever distributing copies or substantial portions of that
code. Upstream source and optional runtime dependencies are not bundled by this
notice or enabled by default.

MIT applies to HippoRAG itself, not automatically to its dependencies. In
particular, the reviewed igraph dependency is GPL-2.0-or-later, tqdm includes
MPL-2.0 terms, and numerical wheels contain separately licensed native libraries.
Review the actual source and binary contents, modifications, integration and
distribution obligations before shipping an optional runtime. This notice is
not a completed dependency license audit or a legal conclusion.

Development evidence and remaining distribution checks:
`docs/evidence/HIPPORAG_OFFICIAL_2026-11-10.md` in the repository root.
